  "solution": "Solution:\n\nThe given equation is: 14 * 7 * 88 * 37 * 47 \n\nOption 1: +, ×, =, −\n\n⇒ 14 + 7 × 88 = 37 - 47 \n\nLHS: 14 + **7 × 88** \n\n**14 + 616** = 630\n\nRHS: 37 - 47 = -10\n\n∵ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2: −, +, =, × \n\n14 - 7 + 88 = 37 × 47 \n\nLHS: 14 **- 7 + 88 **= 14 + 81\n\n⇒ 95\n\nRHS: **37 × 47 **= 1739\n\n∵ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3: =, −, ×, +\n\n14 = 7 - 88 × 37 + 47 \n\nLHS: 14\n\nRHS = 7 - **88 × 37** + 47 \n\n⇒ 7 **-** **3256 + 47 **= 7 - 3209\n\n⇒ - 3202\n\n∵ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4: ×, −, +, =\n\n14 ×7 - 88 + 37 = 47 \n\nLHS: **14 × 7** - 88 + 37\n\n⇒ 98 **-** **88 + 37 **=** **98 -** **51\n\n⇒ 47\n\nRHS: 47\n\n∵ LHS = RHS\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".**\n\n79:Tf8",
